WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.415 --> 00:00:02.029
(bright music)

00:00:02.029 --> 00:00:03.991
- [Ellen] My job is
actually 24 hours a day

00:00:03.991 --> 00:00:06.081
to take care of my hands.

00:00:06.081 --> 00:00:09.042
- [Susan] I'm definitely
very cautious with my hands.

00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:12.664
I'm more careful. I'm more
delicate with my movements.

00:00:12.664 --> 00:00:15.926
- [Nico] I get manicures
fairly frequently.

00:00:15.926 --> 00:00:17.843
I don't do them myself.

00:00:20.977 --> 00:00:22.521
- My name is Ellen Surat.

00:00:22.521 --> 00:00:23.354
- Susan Schell

00:00:23.354 --> 00:00:24.350
- Tom Nico and I am...

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:25.600
- A hand model.

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:29.818
- [Susan] I got noticed as a
hand model after I was featured

00:00:29.818 --> 00:00:32.279
in a jewelry shoot for a
magazine at the jewelry

00:00:32.279 --> 00:00:33.847
company I was working at.

00:00:33.847 --> 00:00:35.484
- [Tom] One day I was
on a commercial shooting

00:00:35.484 --> 00:00:38.827
in Central Park and they picked
me to do all the hand shots

00:00:38.827 --> 00:00:41.161
because the hand model never showed up.

00:00:41.161 --> 00:00:44.621
Probably most of us fall
into it by accident.

00:00:44.621 --> 00:00:46.745
- [Ellen] I'm always in
these upside down positions

00:00:46.745 --> 00:00:49.625
and having to have the
director on top of me

00:00:49.625 --> 00:00:51.215
or underneath me.

00:00:51.215 --> 00:00:53.340
- [Sarah] You're being asked
to do the most natural things

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:55.673
in the most unnatural ways.

00:00:55.673 --> 00:00:59.672
- [Tom] Sometimes I am in weird positions.

00:00:59.672 --> 00:01:03.963
- [Sarah] For my oddest
hand shoot, I had to pretend

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:06.463
to chop a live human placenta.

00:01:07.353 --> 00:01:08.688
- [Ellen] I had to do
this one thing where I had

00:01:08.688 --> 00:01:11.730
to be on Howard Stern's kinda naked body.

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:13.483
(laughs)

00:01:13.483 --> 00:01:14.691
- [Tom] He says to me, look,

00:01:14.691 --> 00:01:16.315
we're going to try something different.

00:01:16.315 --> 00:01:20.205
I want you to stick your
thumb in the girl's mouth.

00:01:20.205 --> 00:01:22.654
I've been a hand model around 19 years.

00:01:22.654 --> 00:01:23.664
It's been great.

00:01:23.664 --> 00:01:25.162
I've been very lucky.

00:01:25.162 --> 00:01:27.078
- [Ellen] I feel like, I'm
gonna do this 'til I'm 90.

00:01:27.078 --> 00:01:27.911
(laughs)

00:01:27.911 --> 00:01:30.193
My hands are going to look
great and I love doing it

00:01:30.193 --> 00:01:31.026
(bell dings)

00:01:31.026 --> 00:01:35.193
and you always need a hand
that looks really good.

